{"type":"text","timestamp":1794377401721,"sessionID":"ses_e36c92cabffe1cdrQ9t4Hp4h3a","part":{"id":"prt_1c93a4558001e45IFz55TFI0pY","messageID":"msg_1c93a34c7001PxJ3LXElldmcAN","sessionID":"ses_e36c92cabffe1cdrQ9t4Hp4h3a","type":"text","text":"<think>TypeScript 7.0.2 is the latest (native port). Let's use typescript 5.9.x for stability? TS 7 might be fine but let's be conservative: use typescript@5.9.3 (it exists? let me check). The error was only about @types/react@19.3.1. Let me check typescript versions.\n\nActually, since Vite doesn't typecheck during build, typescript is only for editor/typecheck script. I'll install typescript@5 and @types/react@19.3.0, @types/react-dom@19.3.0.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794377401688,"end":1794377401715}}}
