{"type":"text","timestamp":1794377642637,"sessionID":"ses_e36c92cabffe1cdrQ9t4Hp4h3a","part":{"id":"prt_1c93df27b001J7KUN7F4pLwJZg","messageID":"msg_1c93de276001MqwPDnvIBY3aNF","sessionID":"ses_e36c92cabffe1cdrQ9t4Hp4h3a","type":"text","text":"<think>All API checks pass. Now let me verify the frontend works in a browser-like environment. I can't run a real browser easily... Let me check if there's a headless browser available (playwright/puppeteer). Probably not. Let me check.\n\nActually, let me check if node has puppeteer/playwright available. The sandbox has no other network access except package registries, so I could install playwright but the browser download would fail (playwright downloads browsers from a CDN). Let me check if chromium is installed.\n\nLet me check for chrome/chromium binaries.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794377642619,"end":1794377642634}}}
